{"content-gap":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Content Gap</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">GapSize sets the space between the header, body, and footer. The default uiToolset.GapSizeMd renders gap-3.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoBody(),\n\tFooterContent: CardDemoFooter(),\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderTitle: &#34;Tight Gap&#34;,\n\tGapSize:     uiToolset.GapSizeSm,\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Tight Gap</h2></span> </div></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p><!-- CardFooterContent --> <div class=\"border-t border-neutral-50/10 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Card footer content sits below the body.</p></div></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Loose Gap</h2></span> </div></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p><!-- CardFooterContent --> <div class=\"border-t border-neutral-50/10 pt-3\"><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">Card footer content sits below the body.</p></div></div></div></div>","content-only-card":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Content-Only Card</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">With no header settings the card is a bare surface around MiddleContent.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoContentOnlyBody(),\n})</code></pre></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg shadow-sm \"><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Content-only card body without a heading block above it.</p></div></div>","custom-header-slot":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Custom Header Slot</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">HeaderContent replaces the standard header block with your own component.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoBody(),\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderContent: CardDemoCustomHeader(),\n})</code></pre></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardCustomHeader --> <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-neutral-50/10 pb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><i class=\"ph-duotone ph-rocket-launch text-xl text-primary-300\"></i> <span class=\"font-bold\">Deploy Pipeline</span></div><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-200\">Ready</span></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div></div>","header-icon-styles":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Header Icon Styles</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">HeaderIcon stamps a Phosphor icon in the header. Position, color, background, radius, and padding size style it.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoBody(),\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderIcon:                &#34;ph-cube&#34;,\n\tHeaderIconPosition:        uiDisplay.HeaderIconPositionLeft,\n\tHeaderIconColor:           &#34;primary-100&#34;,\n\tHeaderIconBackgroundColor: &#34;primary-500/30&#34;,\n\tHeaderIconBorderRadius:    uiToolset.BorderRadiusLg,\n\tHeaderIconPaddingSize:     uiToolset.PaddingSizeMd,\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-cube text-secondary-100 bg-secondary-500/30 p-2 rounded-lg\"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-center\">Icon on Top</h2></span> </div></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-star text-amber-300 bg-amber-500/20 p-1.5 rounded-xl\"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Icon on Left</h2></span> </div></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div></div></div>","header-styling":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Header Styling</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">HeaderSize scales the title and sub-heading. HeaderTitleColor and HeaderSubHeadingColor tint them. TextCase transforms both.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoBody(),\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderTitle:           &#34;Styled Header&#34;,\n\tHeaderSubHeading:      &#34;Sized, tinted, and uppercased&#34;,\n\tHeaderSize:            uiDisplay.HeaderSizeLg,\n\tHeaderTitleColor:      &#34;amber-300&#34;,\n\tHeaderSubHeadingColor: &#34;amber-200/70&#34;,\n\tTextCase:              uiToolset.TextCaseUpper,\n})</code></pre></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-2xl text-amber-300 uppercase\">Styled Header</h2></span> </div><p class=\"text-base text-amber-200/70 uppercase \">Sized, tinted, and uppercased</p></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div></div>","state-bound-header":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">State-Bound Header</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">HeaderTitleOneWayStatePath and HeaderSubHeadingOneWayStatePath drive the header text from Alpine state.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoBody(),\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderTitle:                      &#34;Card Title&#34;,\n\tHeaderTitleOneWayStatePath:       &#34;cardTitle&#34;,\n\tHeaderSubHeadingOneWayStatePath:  &#34;cardSubHeading&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div><div x-data=\"{cardTitle: 'Live Title', cardSubHeading: 'Bound to Alpine state'}\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-lg  \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-arrows-clockwise   \"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\" x-text=\"cardTitle\">Live Title</h2></span> </div><p class=\"text-sm opacity-80 \" x-text=\"cardSubHeading\"></p></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"cardTitle = &#39;Updated at &#39; + new Date().toLocaleTimeString(); cardSubHeading = &#39;Just now&#39;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-pencil text-base\"></i> Change Header </button> </div></div></div>","surface-edges":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Surface &amp; Edges</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Background, text, radius, shadow, ring, and padding accept Tailwind tokens.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/structural/card.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiStructural.Card(uiStructural.CardSettings{\n\tMiddleContent: CardDemoBody(),\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tBackgroundColor:  &#34;primary-900/60&#34;,\n\tTextColor:        &#34;neutral-50&#34;,\n\tPaddingSize:      uiToolset.PaddingSizeLg,\n\tBorderRadius:     uiToolset.BorderRadiusNone,\n\tShadowSize:       uiToolset.ShadowSizeLg,\n\tRingColor:        &#34;primary-500&#34;,\n\tRingThickness:    uiToolset.RingThicknessMd,\n\tHeaderSubHeading: &#34;Custom background, text, and ring&#34;,\n\tActionsContent:   CardDemoActions(),\n})</code></pre></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-primary-900/60 text-neutral-50 p-6 rounded-lg  ring-2 ring-primary-500\"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-palette   \"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Tinted Card</h2></span> </div><p class=\"text-sm opacity-80 \">Custom background, text, and ring</p></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div><!-- Card --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 bg-neutral-950/20  p-5 rounded-none shadow-lg \"><!-- CardHeader --> <!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-square   \"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Square Card</h2></span> <!-- HeaderBlockActions --> <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-fit bg-secondary-800 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-plus text-base\"></i> Action </button> </div></div></div></div><!-- CardMiddleContent --><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Cards group related content on a surface. This body is the MiddleContent, so the card only styles the container and the optional heading.</p></div></div>"}
